<title>USA: RenaissanceRe mulling secondary offering.</title>
<headline>RenaissanceRe mulling secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>RenaissanceRe Holdings Ltd said Tuesday it is contemplating filing a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a secondary offering of about three million common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it would sell the shares subject to market conditions at the request of its initial institutional investors.</p>
<p>The company said all shares in the contemplated offering would be sold by its initial institutional investors.</p>
</text>
